WEBVTT

00:00:00.367 --> 00:00:02.900
Are you a SMART fella,

00:00:02.900 --> 00:00:04.933
or a FART smella?

00:00:04.933 --> 00:00:06.433
Let's find OUT!

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:08.300
Okay,

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:10.367
a number analogy!

00:00:10.367 --> 00:00:12.467
Four makes eleven,

00:00:12.467 --> 00:00:14.533
five makes fourteen,

00:00:14.533 --> 00:00:16.633
six makes seventeen,

00:00:16.633 --> 00:00:18.700
so nine makes...

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:19.400
what?

00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:20.100
A.

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:20.800
Twenty-three,

00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:21.500
B.

00:00:21.500 --> 00:00:22.167
Twenty-six,

00:00:22.167 --> 00:00:22.867
C.

00:00:22.867 --> 00:00:23.567
Twenty-four,

00:00:23.567 --> 00:00:24.967
or D.

00:00:24.967 --> 00:00:25.667
Twenty-seven?

00:00:25.667 --> 00:00:27.033
Five seconds!

00:00:32.833 --> 00:00:34.033
TIME'S UP!

00:00:34.700 --> 00:00:36.267
The answer is...

00:00:36.267 --> 00:00:36.767
B,

00:00:36.767 --> 00:00:37.300
twenty-six!

00:00:37.300 --> 00:00:40.400
Each number is multiplied by three

00:00:40.400 --> 00:00:42.467
then take away one,

00:00:42.467 --> 00:00:44.533
so nine becomes twenty-six.

00:00:45.700 --> 00:00:47.267
Check this out,

00:00:47.267 --> 00:00:48.833
a word analogy!

00:00:48.833 --> 00:00:50.933
Light is to dark,

00:00:50.933 --> 00:00:53.033
as fast is to...

00:00:53.033 --> 00:00:53.533
what?

00:00:53.533 --> 00:00:54.067
A.

00:00:54.067 --> 00:00:54.600
Slow,

00:00:54.600 --> 00:00:55.100
B.

00:00:55.100 --> 00:00:55.633
Night,

00:00:55.633 --> 00:00:56.167
C.

00:00:56.167 --> 00:00:56.700
Down,

00:00:56.700 --> 00:00:57.733
or D.

00:00:57.733 --> 00:00:58.267
Late?

00:00:58.267 --> 00:00:59.300
Five seconds!

00:01:05.100 --> 00:01:06.300
TIME'S UP!

00:01:06.967 --> 00:01:07.467
It's...

00:01:07.467 --> 00:01:07.967
A,

00:01:07.967 --> 00:01:08.500
slow!

00:01:08.500 --> 00:01:11.033
Light and dark are opposites,

00:01:11.033 --> 00:01:14.567
so the opposite of fast is slow.

00:01:15.733 --> 00:01:17.167
Check this out,

00:01:17.167 --> 00:01:19.067
fill in the blank!

00:01:19.067 --> 00:01:21.933
The riddle was so blank that

00:01:21.933 --> 00:01:24.800
it took her all afternoon to

00:01:24.800 --> 00:01:25.767
solve it.

00:01:25.767 --> 00:01:26.233
A.

00:01:26.233 --> 00:01:26.700
Easy,

00:01:26.700 --> 00:01:27.200
B.

00:01:27.200 --> 00:01:27.667
Silly,

00:01:27.667 --> 00:01:28.133
C.

00:01:28.133 --> 00:01:28.633
Difficult,

00:01:28.633 --> 00:01:29.567
or D.

00:01:29.567 --> 00:01:30.067
Short?

00:01:30.067 --> 00:01:31.000
Five seconds!

00:01:36.800 --> 00:01:38.000
TIME'S UP!

00:01:38.667 --> 00:01:39.467
It's...

00:01:39.467 --> 00:01:40.233
C,

00:01:40.233 --> 00:01:41.033
difficult!

00:01:41.033 --> 00:01:45.000
Taking all afternoon means difficult.

00:01:46.133 --> 00:01:46.533
So,

00:01:46.533 --> 00:01:48.567
are you smart or fart?

00:01:48.567 --> 00:01:51.000
Count up your correct answers to

00:01:51.000 --> 00:01:52.200
find your rank!

00:01:53.367 --> 00:01:53.700
So,

00:01:53.700 --> 00:01:55.100
how did you do?

00:01:55.100 --> 00:01:56.467
Comment your score below,

00:01:56.467 --> 00:01:57.833
and follow for more!
